### Requests de ejemplo (extensión "REST Client" de VS Code, o IntelliJ HTTP Client)
@host = http://localhost:3000

### Portfolio del usuario 1
GET {{host}}/users/1/portfolio

### Buscar activos por ticker o nombre
GET {{host}}/instruments?q=mol

### MARKET BUY por cantidad
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10 }

### MARKET BUY por monto en pesos (compra el máximo de acciones enteras)
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "amount": 10000 }

### LIMIT SELL (queda NEW)
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "SELL", "type": "LIMIT", "size": 5, "price": 1000 }

### MARKET BUY idempotente: repetir este request devuelve la misma orden (200, header Idempotency-Replayed)
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: compra-001

{ "userId": 1, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10 }
